格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness homepage-style chat background skin: fluid + dot grid + digitile whale","id":"gh:1334565624","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-skin","slug":"changan0617/dsh-skin","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness homepage-style chat background skin: fluid + dot grid + digitile whale"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-skin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 首页风格聊天背景皮肤 —— 对照 deepseek.com/harness 首页逐行移植：WebGL 流体背景 + 白色点线网格 + 数字点云鲸鱼。插件化安装，可在插"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ness 首页风格聊天背景皮肤 —— 对照 deepseek.com/harness 首页逐行移植：WebGL 流体背景 + 白色点线网格 + 数字点云鲸鱼。插件化安装，可在插件管理里随时启用/停用。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A homepage-style chat background skin for DeepSeek Harness (WebGL fluid + dot-line grid + digital po"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"int-cloud whale), installable as a normal dsh plugin."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 效果 / Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- 首页同款 WebGL 流体背景（5 色噪声场 + 流场笔刷 + 光源/辉光/暗角/颗粒，shader 原样移植官方页面）\n- 白色 90px 点线网格（鼠标扰动 + 弹簧回弹，官方同款物理）\n- "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"鲸鱼 = 数字点云（HeroDigitileR3F 移植）：粒子聚成鲸形、呼吸游动、鼠标径向推开、光标光束提亮\n- 深色主题生效；reduced-motion 自动停用；不监听点击事件"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 安装 / Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"重启 `dsh web` 后生效。卸载："},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 文件 / Files"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| 文件 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `lib/client.js` | 皮肤客户端 bundle（流体 + 网格 + 鲸鱼点云，含全部交互与参数） |\n| `lib/index.js` | 宿主半边（纯客户端插件，宿主无逻辑） |\n"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"| `cordis.patch.yml` | bundle 挂载补丁，插入 `harness-skin` 条目 |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 参数调节 / Tuning"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"均位于 `lib/client.js`，改完重启 `dsh web` 并 Ctrl+F5："},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 效果 | 位置 | 当前值 |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 鲸鱼基础透明度 | `baseAlpha` | `0.25 + 0.28 * D` |\n| 鲸鱼粒子大小 | `size = 0.09 * unit` | 0.09 |\n| 鲸鱼大小 | `wha"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"leW = Math.min(W, H) * 0.52` | 0.52 |\n| 鲸鱼位置 | `cx = contentCX` / `cy = H * 0.45` | 内容区居中 |\n| 鼠标提亮范围"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" | `BEAM_R` | 10 |\n| 鼠标提亮强度 | alpha 行 `(1 + 0.35 * beam)` | 0.35 |\n| 粒子推开半径/强度 | `MOUSE_R` / `MOUSE_"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"STR` | 4.9 / 0.8 |\n| 流体是否被鼠标扭曲 | flowmap `brushStrength` 后的值 | 0（关闭） |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 注意 / Notes"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- 皮肤仅在深色主题（`body[data-ds-dark-theme]`）下生效。\n- 系统开启「减少动态效果」时脚本自动停用动画。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT © 2026 changan0617"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
